Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(ui): show clearance stock advice on Heights

Show the existing advice for live draft values before Generate. Cache the display result by its actual inputs and pin its visibility.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #2131
